From 0076fd985d6091c378473f9605e0d9c211337576 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jose Antonio Montenegro Montes <jmmontes@uma.es>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 16:32:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mtc): require the configured Standalone lab cosigner

Load the additional signer from the laboratory trust configuration and require its valid cosignature alongside the CA signature for Standalone verification. Forward lab policy and key lookups through the system and certificate-verifier trust-store layers, while retaining public mirror-key precedence.

Validation reported by the operator: net_unittests and chrome built successfully; focused lab configuration and trust-store tests passed; six profile triplets completed with two effective Standalone signatures each. Negative end-to-end missing/corrupt cosignature cases remain deferred.
